            Find Tech Debt.<br/>
            <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-[#8B5CF6] text-transparent bg-clip-text">Before It Finds You.</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-xl text-outline font-body-md max-w-2xl mt-4 hero-subtitle">
            AI-powered code review that scans, analyzes, and fixes your repositories in minutes - not days. Command-line precision meets deep-space telemetry.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-4 hero-cta">
            <a href="/scan" class="bg-accent text-white font-label-md px-8 py-4 rounded flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.4)] btn-primary no-underline">
